    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok here is what i have: april 4th 2am-4am (oak st), april 7th 3am-5am (maple ave), april 11th 1am-3am (oak st), april 14th 2am-4am (elm st), april 18th 3am-5am (oak st). notice how they only ever come out in those middle of the night hours? like why would a water company do \"emergency\" repairs at 2am if it's not to avoid people seeing what they're actually doing? it seems like they're trying to be as quiet as possible and stay under the radar. can you look at these times and tell me if the timing itself feels weird or if it looks like they're trying to hide something?",
